sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Người dùng
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant VM as WorkspaceViewModel
    participant Vision as VisionReviewService
    participant Detector as DiagramDetector
    participant Classifier as DiagramTypeClassifier
    participant Renderer as PageImageRenderer
    participant API as ApiService
    participant Proxy as FastAPI /diagram
    participant Describe as Gemini Describe
    participant Judge as Gemini Judge
    participant Store as SessionStore

    User->>UI: Audit diagrams
    UI->>VM: auditDiagrams()
    VM->>VM: require current PDF bytes
    VM->>Vision: audit(document)
    Vision->>Detector: detect diagram intent
    Vision->>Classifier: classify named diagram type
    Vision->>Vision: candidates = named pages first + visual-only pages
    Vision->>Vision: candidates named first plus visual-only, take 10 pages
    loop mỗi candidate trong ngân sách
        Vision->>Renderer: renderPage(pageIndex)
        Renderer-->>Vision: PNG bytes
        Vision->>API: POST /diagram(page, type, context, image_b64)
        API->>Proxy: request + auth headers
        Proxy->>Describe: call 1: describe elements/relations
        Describe-->>Proxy: DiagramDescribe
        Proxy->>Judge: call 2: judge notation
        Judge-->>Proxy: DiagramVerdict
        Proxy->>Proxy: bind effective family (DOC if no inventory)
        Proxy-->>API: DiagramAuditResult
        API-->>Vision: result
        Vision->>Vision: create stable ledger row
    end
    Vision-->>VM: findings + failures + skipped pages
    VM->>VM: replace diagramAudit rows only
    VM->>Store: saveSnapshot()
    VM-->>UI: audit summary
    opt vượt ngân sách
        Vision-->>VM: skipped page indexes
    end
    opt toàn bộ audit lỗi
        VM-->>UI: no verdict written
    end
